  {
   "n": 2,
   "id": "187baff6",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Cannabis 101: The Complete Beginner’s Guide from Cape Cod Cannabis",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cannabis is a powerful, diverse, and often misunderstood plant. Whether you’re brand new or simply curious about the wide range of products available, this guide will walk you through <strong>THC vs CBD, strain types, terpenes, dosing, consumption methods, and Massachusetts cannabis laws</strong>.</p><p>At <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong>, we want every customer to feel informed, confident, and supported — whether you visit our dispensary in Wellfleet or pre-order online.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "id": "8a91de6",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "divider"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "id": "b10a0a6",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Understanding Cannabinoids",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cannabinoids are the active compounds in cannabis that influence how you feel.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "THC (Delta-9-Tetrahydrocannabinol)"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>THC is responsible for the psychoactive effects of cannabis or the “high.” It may support:</p><p><br>• Relaxation<br>• Euphoria<br>• Enhanced sensory awareness<br>• Appetite stimulation</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "CBD (Cannabidiol)"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>CBD doesn’t produce a high. Many people use it for:</p><p><br>• Calm and balance<br>• Discomfort relief<br>• Reduced inflammation<br>• Stress support</p><p>Together, THC and CBD interact to create the <strong>entourage effect</strong>, meaning they work better in combination than alone.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "id": "a9b863a",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "button",
     "label": "Learn More About Cannabinoids",
     "href": "/an-introduction-to-cannabinoids/"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "id": "163071b",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "divider"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "id": "d69f480",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Terpenes: Aroma, Flavor & Effect",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Terpenes are aromatic oils that influence cannabis flavor, scent, and effects.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Common Terpenes Found in Cannabis"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Myrcene</strong> – earthy, relaxing<br><strong>Limonene</strong> – citrus, uplifting<br><strong>Pinene</strong> – pine-like, refreshing clarity<br><strong>Linalool</strong> – floral, calming<br><strong>Caryophyllene</strong> – peppery, grounding</p><p>Terpenes help you choose strains based on preference and not just THC percentage.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "id": "c764acd",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "button",
     "label": "Learn More About Terpenes",
     "href": "/an-introduction-to-terpenes/"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "id": "9a45d92",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "divider"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "id": "6978400",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Strain Types:",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Indica"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Commonly associated with calming, relaxing effects. Popular for nighttime use.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Sativa"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Often uplifting and energizing. Many choose sativas for daytime activities.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Hybrid"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>A balanced mix of both. Effects vary based on genetics and terpene profile.</p><p><em>Tip:</em> Everyone reacts differently and the effects depend on tolerance, body chemistry, and method of use.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "id": "5c3165e",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "button",
     "label": "Learn More or Shop by Strain Type",
     "href": "/strains/"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
