  {
   "n": 13,
   "id": "9e59f01",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Cannabis Product Types & How to Use Them",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Flower"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>• <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">Flower</a> can be smoked or vaporized<br>• Fast onset within minutes<br>• Easy to control dosage</p><p><a href=\"/lifecycle-of-a-cannabis-seed/\">Learn about the Lifecycle of a Cannabis Seed</a></p><p><a href=\"/the-myth-of-high-thc-potency/\">Learn more about The Myth of High THC Potency</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Pre-Rolls"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">Ready-to-enjoy rolls</a> made from ground flower. Great for convenience and sharing. <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">Shop Pre-Rolls now</a>!</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Edibles"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>• <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">Gummies, chocolates, baked goods or beverages</a>. <br>• Onset: 30–120 minutes<br>• Duration: 3–8 hours</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> Start with a low dose and wait for effects.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Vapes"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>• <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/cartridges/\">Cartridges</a> or <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/disposables/\">disposable pens</a><br>• Fast-acting, smooth, and discreet</p><p><a href=\"/warning-cartridge-disposable-vape-consumers/\">Learn about the Best Practices for Vape Storage</a></p><p><a href=\"/the-ins-and-outs-of-vaping/\">The Ins and Outs of Vaping</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Concentrates"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Shatter, wax, rosin, live resin. Very potent and recommended for experienced users.</p><p><a href=\"/understanding-cannabis-concentrates-types-and-uses/\">Learn more about Concentrates</a> or</p><p>view <a href=\"/the-ultimate-dabbing-temperature-guide/\">The Ultimate Dabbing Temperature Guide</a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Tinctures"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>• <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">Tinctures</a> can be dropped under the tongue or mixed into drinks. <br>• Easy, smoke-free dosing<br>• Great for consistent daily use</p><p><a href=\"/holiday-cannabis-infused-drink-recipes/\">Learn about Holiday Drink Recipes using tinctures</a> (non-alcoholic) or</p><p><a href=\"/cannabis-infused-summer-drink-recipes-2025/\">Learn about Summer Drink Recipes using tinctures</a> (non-alcoholic)</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Topicals"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/categories/topicals/\">Topicals can include Creams, balms, and lotions</a><br>• No psychoactive effects<br>• Ideal for targeted relief</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
