  {
   "n": 19,
   "id": "777a8f6",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "MA Recreational Cannabis Purchase Limits",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Adults <strong>21+</strong> may purchase:</p><p>• Up to 2<strong> ounces of flower</strong> (56g) or it’s equivalent per day <em><strong>(updated 4/20/26)</strong></em><br>• Or equivalent amounts of edibles, tinctures, concentrates, or vape products</p><p>Consumption is only permitted on private property, and driving under the influence is illegal.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "id": "6812d2f",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
