    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "id": "d6292c4",
   "doc": "wp-post#152647",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "How to Choose the Right Cannabis Product",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Consider the following:</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "1. Desired Effects"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Relaxation, focus, creativity, calm, or sleep support.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "2. Consumption Preference"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Smoking, vaping, edibles, tinctures, or topicals.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "3. Potency & Cannabinoid Profile"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Not all high-THC products are “stronger.” Balance matters.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "4. Aroma & Flavor Preferences"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Terpenes help guide your choices.</p><p>If you’re unsure, our team at <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong> is always happy to help.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
