     "level": 1,
     "text": "Your Cannabis Journey Begins Here",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Whether you’re exploring flower, pre-rolls, tinctures, concentrates, or edibles, this Cannabis 101 guide is designed to help you shop with clarity and confidence.</p><p>Visit <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet</strong> or browse our menu online to discover the products that fit your lifestyle.</p><p><strong>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary</strong></p><p><strong>1446 US-6</strong></p><p><strong>Wellfleet, MA 02667</strong></p><p><strong>(774) 383-3133</strong></p><p><a href=\"/directions/\">Click here for directions</a></p>"
    }
